# GitHub issue comments

Do not post, reply to, or otherwise publish a comment on a GitHub issue
unless the user has explicitly authorized that post in this conversation
(for example: "post this", "comment on the issue", "reply to #123").

Reading issues, drafting comment text for the user to paste, and creating
pull requests when asked are all allowed. Fixing an issue, summarizing it,
or being given an issue URL is not authorization to comment.

This includes `gh issue comment`, GitHub MCP comment tools, and any other
API or UI that publishes an issue comment.
